### Before Submitting Work
1. Run `~/bin/pr-precheck fix` once before the first push (lint with autocorrect and the tests tied to changed files)
2. Fix any failures before proceeding
3. Self-review:
   - Re-read ticket acceptance criteria - verify each is met
   - Check for leftover debug code, TODOs, or commented-out code
   - Verify no unintended file changes (migrations, lock files, configs)
   - Confirm each lock, guard and allow-list has a test where it triggers
4. Commit using the format from Git and Version Control
